# ---------- Local agent tooling (never deployed) ----------
.claude/
# AGENTS.md is intentionally tracked: it carries the shared agent policy
# (Ponytail, Caveman, verify-don't-recall, no-push-without-confirmation) so the
# policy travels with the repo instead of living only in ~/.dsh on one machine.
REASONIX.md
reasonix.toml
.playwright-mcp/
repomix-output.xml
package*.json

